- rank-space would drop more votes and increase top-of-board F1 rejections;
- per-vote would more than double the drops (35,423 vs 15,500);
- n=3 would move IDP values up to -40%/+35%, away from DLF's later vote;
- V1 would let wrong-player and x0.2/x0.05 corrupted votes through and miss the IDPTC scale glitch.
Rollback is RISKIT_FEATURE_<FLAG>=0 plus a restart.

